& [Inside]
  + pure A5 adapter over unchanged A4 and legacy verifiers; canonical request receipt independent evidence and ignored fixture producer
  + decode-key equality exact A1/A3 artifact association expected decision identity supplied-time comparison and truthful receipts

& [Boundary]
  + input class is local to A5; upstream fixture classes may differ and cannot confer trust
  + files must remain stable during bounded reads; metadata checks are not an atomic filesystem snapshot or OS sandbox
  + readiness means formation-to-implementation permission only, never readiness to execute the decision

& [Outside]
